@startuml
title Physical generation roles

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EDF4FA
  BorderColor #315B7D
  ArrowColor #315B7D
}

state "ACTIVE" as Active
state "SHADOW" as Shadow
state "RETIRED" as Retired

[*] --> Active : ordinary table / default role
Active : user-visible
Active : serves logical relation L
Active : eligible for ordinary enumeration

[*] --> Shadow : migration creates G1
Shadow : internally writable
Shadow : hidden from users / backup / CDC discovery
Shadow : owning_migration_id required

Shadow --> Active : authoritative cutover K
Active --> Retired : authoritative cutover K

Retired : not user-visible
Retired : retained by CDC / PITR / rollback owners
Retired --> [*] : all retention owners released

Shadow --> [*] : cancel before K / cleanup

note bottom of Shadow
  Generation role is independent of hide_state.
  SHADOW is not a dropped HIDDEN object.
end note
@enduml
